# Sprint C: Agent SDK v2 — Multi-Goal Planning, Checkpoint/Resume, Self-Healing

## Context

Sprint B (TOPS/PDG) is complete: 14 handlers, 14 MCP tools, 87 tests, 3 recipes, 2 resource templates. The Agent SDK v1 (`~/.synapse/agent/`) has 12 tools, a linear tool-use loop (MAX_TURNS=30), and no planning, checkpointing, or self-healing capability. Sprint C evolves the agent from a simple tool-use loop into a planning-capable, self-healing co-pilot with TOPS integration and checkpoint/resume.

**Sprint C filesystem gates** (from `docs/agent/AGENT_V2_SPRINT.md`):
```
~/.synapse/agent/synapse_planner.py      # Multi-goal planner
~/.synapse/agent/synapse_checkpoint.py   # Checkpoint/resume
~/.synapse/agent/tests/test_planner.py   # Planner tests (must pass)
```

**All code lives in `~/.synapse/agent/`** — this is the agent SDK repo, NOT the core Synapse repo.

